    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Grave Resistance.</strong> You have Resistance to Cold damage and Necrotic damage.</p><p><strong>Siphon Life.</strong> When an enemy within 120 feet of you is reduced to 0 Hit Points, you can take a Reaction to regain 50 Hit Points. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
